        "Content": "*BEING SOLD WITH TENANT IN SITU @ c. 22,500 PER ANNUM*\r\n\r\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this ready to go investment property to the market within Rath Geal, Dublin 22.\r\nThis superb development is maintained to a very high standard and boasts ample parking and a fantastic communal garden area. Rath Geal is located just off the New Nangor Road in Clondalkin, approximately 11.5 km west of Dublin City Centre. Situated minutes from Clondalkin Village, Profile Park, Grange Castle Business Park, The Mill Shopping Centre and the N7 (Naas Road) along the Outer Ring Road easily accessing the N4 and M50 road networks. There are excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre via Dublin Bus.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n• c. 45 sq.m\r\n• BER C2\r\n• 1 bed/1 bath\r\n• First floor apartment\r\n• Management fee c. 1,800 per annum\r\n• Being sold with excellent tenant in situ @ c. 22,500 per annum\r\n\r\n\r\nCall Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information."
